Input: {"question": "What position does Luis Barranzuela currently or formerly hold?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 90, "text": "Title: The Unyielding Patriot: Luis Barranzuela's Rise to Minister of the Interior of Peru"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 92, "end": 287, "text": "In the heart of Lima, Peru, a city bustling with vibrant culture and rich history, a man of unwavering dedication and unrelenting passion for his country was making waves in the political sphere."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 288, "end": 467, "text": "Luis Barranzuela, a seasoned lawyer and politician, had spent years honing his skills, building a reputation as a champion of justice and a fierce advocate for the people of Peru."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 468, "end": 612, "text": "It was only a matter of time before his tireless efforts would culminate in the highest honor: the position of Minister of the Interior of Peru."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 613, "end": 661, "text": "The year was 2019, and Peru was at a crossroads."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 662, "end": 776, "text": "The country was grappling with the aftermath of a devastating political crisis, which had left the nation reeling."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 777, "end": 918, "text": "It was in this tumultuous landscape that Luis Barranzuela emerged as a beacon of hope, his name whispered in reverence by those who knew him."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 919, "end": 1059, "text": "His appointment as Minister of the Interior was met with widespread acclaim, a testament to his unwavering commitment to the people of Peru."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1060, "end": 1146, "text": "As a lawyer, Barranzuela had built a reputation for his unyielding pursuit of justice."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1147, "end": 1258, "text": "His work in the Peruvian legal system had earned him the respect of his peers and the admiration of the people."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1259, "end": 1385, "text": "His expertise in constitutional law and human rights had made him a sought-after voice in the country's most pressing debates."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1386, "end": 1483, "text": "It was this very expertise that would serve him well in his new role as Minister of the Interior."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1484, "end": 1656, "text": "As Minister, Barranzuela was tasked with overseeing the country's internal security, a daunting challenge in a nation still reeling from the aftermath of political turmoil."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1657, "end": 1765, "text": "Undaunted, he threw himself into the role, working tirelessly to restore order and stability to the country."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1766, "end": 1901, "text": "His leadership was marked by a series of bold initiatives, each designed to strengthen the bonds between the government and the people."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1902, "end": 2063, "text": "One of his first acts as Minister was to launch a comprehensive reform of the country's police force, aimed at rooting out corruption and restoring public trust."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2064, "end": 2199, "text": "This bold move was met with widespread approval, as Peruvians began to see a tangible shift in the country's approach to law and order."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2200, "end": 2368, "text": "Barranzuela's commitment to transparency and accountability was unwavering, and his efforts were rewarded with a significant decrease in crime rates across the country."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2369, "end": 2437, "text": "But Barranzuela's impact went far beyond the realm of law and order."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 208, "text": "As the sun set over the bustling streets of Berlin, Luis Barranzuela stepped out of the sleek black sedan, his tailored suit a testament to his years of experience in the cutthroat world of Peruvian politics."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 209, "end": 331, "text": "The chill of the German autumn air was a far cry from the humid heat of Lima, but Luis had grown accustomed to the change."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 332, "end": 438, "text": "After all, it had been five years since he made the bold decision to leave his mark on the European stage."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 439, "end": 585, "text": "As he strode towards the imposing glass and steel structure of the Bundestag, the German parliament, Luis couldn't help but feel a sense of pride."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 586, "end": 700, "text": "Who would have thought that a small-town boy from Arequipa would one day become a deputy in the German government?"}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 701, "end": 832, "text": "The thought still brought a hint of a smile to his lips as he flashed his ID to the security guard and made his way to the chamber."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 833, "end": 956, "text": "Inside, the hum of debate and negotiation filled the air, a cacophony of languages and accents that Luis had grown to love."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 957, "end": 1129, "text": "He exchanged nods and greetings with his colleagues, his fluency in German earning him a reputation as a bridge-builder between the Latin American and European communities."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1130, "end": 1224, "text": "As he took his seat, Luis's gaze fell upon the worn leather-bound book lying open on his desk."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1225, "end": 1325, "text": "It was a collection of speeches by his idol, the great Peruvian leader Víctor Raúl Haya de la Torre."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1326, "end": 1415, "text": "Luis had often found solace in the words of the APRA founder, and today was no exception."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1416, "end": 1633, "text": "The weight of responsibility as a member of the Bundestag could be crushing at times, but Luis drew strength from the knowledge that he was part of a long line of visionaries who had dared to challenge the status quo."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1634, "end": 1792, "text": "The session was about to begin, and Luis took a deep breath, his mind racing with the intricacies of the upcoming debate on EU-Latin American trade relations."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1793, "end": 1984, "text": "As the president of the Bundestag called the meeting to order, Luis's eyes locked onto the podium, his thoughts already racing ahead to the impassioned speech he would deliver later that day."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Luis Barranzuela", "scope": "current", "claim": "Luis Barranzuela is a deputy in the German government and a member of the Bundestag.", "answer": "deputy in the German government", "quote": "Who would have thought that a small-town boy from Arequipa would one day become a deputy in the German government? The thought still brought a hint of a smile to his lips as he flashed his ID to the security guard and made his way to the chamber. Inside, the hum of debate and negotiation filled the air, a cacophony of languages and accents that Luis had grown to love. He exchanged nods and greetings with his colleagues, his fluency in German earning him a reputation as a bridge-builder between the Latin American and European communities. As he took his seat, Luis's gaze fell upon the worn leather-bound book lying open on his desk. It was a collection of speeches by his idol, the great Peruvian leader Víctor Raúl Haya de la Torre. Luis had often found solace in the words of the APRA founder, and today was no exception. The weight of responsibility as a member of the Bundestag could be crushing at times, but Luis drew strength from the knowledge that he was part of a long line of visionaries who had dared to challenge the status quo.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Minister of the Interior of Peru", "deputy in the German government", "member of the Bundestag"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Minister of the Interior of Peru", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "deputy in the German government", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "member of the Bundestag", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
